C:Trad arr. © 2012 Ben Paley
N:This beautiful tune appears in my book <a
N:href="https://www.lulu.com/shop/ben-paley/swedish-fiddle-music-an-anthology/paperback/product-2
N:3852695.html">Swedish Fiddle Music, an Anthology</a>, and featured on the accompanying cassette
N:which is <a
N:href="https://benpaley-fiddle.bandcamp.com/album/swedish-fiddle-music-an-anthology">now
N:available for download</a>. Or you can <a
N:href="https://benpaley-fiddle.bandcamp.com/track/brudmarsch-fr-n-n-s-48">download just this
N:track</a>.
